sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee
    participant Product as Mesa Tica
    Employee->>Product: Open order from queue
    Product-->>Employee: Accepted number, time, items, quantities, prices, total and current state
    Product-->>Employee: Staff status history and permitted next actions
    Note over Employee,Product: Later menu changes do not alter accepted order details.
    Employee->>Product: Return to queue
    Product-->>Employee: Preserve selected filter
